L("Arthouse Animation","broad","An auteur-driven animated feature made for the festival and art-cinema circuit, usually outside the US studio system (<i>The Triplets of Belleville</i>, <i>The Secret of Kells</i>, <i>Persepolis</i>, <i>Flow</i>). Stop-motion auteur features go to C12-16; mainstream European family films to C12-7.",["Independent_animation","Cartoon_Saloon","Art_film"],"auteur animation; independent animation; European animation","C12-16 Stop-Motion Feature; C12-7 International Family Animated Feature","by national tradition",["French & Belgian Auteur Animation","Cartoon Saloon & British Arthouse","Central & Eastern European","Iberian & Latin American","North American, Israeli & South Asian Independent"]),
