L("European Children's Animated Series","medium","A children's series from a European tradition, from Soyuzmultfilm and the Czech, Polish and Hungarian studios to British and French television (<i>Well, Just You Wait!</i>, <i>The Adventures of the Mole</i>, <i>Bolek and Lolek</i>, <i>Oggy and the Cockroaches</i>). European preschool series go to C13-15.",["Soyuzmultfilm","Bolek_and_Lolek"],"Eastern Bloc animation; European cartoons","C13-15 Preschool Animated Series","by national tradition",["Soviet & Russian","Central European","Western European"]),
